GATE-A Rbar(Schwarzschild isotropic) = 0
GATE-B Va(Schwarzschild isotropic)   = 256*GM2*alpha*r_**4/((sqrt(GM2) - 2*r_)**2*(sqrt(GM2) + 2*r_)**6)
        Va(alpha=0)                  = 0
GATE-C on-shell eps^2 density (point U, r->1/t): GM2*t**4*(alpha + 6)
        1/r^4 harmonic S = GM2*(alpha + 6)   [lapse-source: (6+alpha)|DU|^2 family]
        lapse-source at alpha=0: 6*GM2
